  "content": "<table style=\"width:100%\">\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"width:124px;text-align:center\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex\">\n        <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/zipestudio.png?raw=true\">\n      </div>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <div style=\"display:flex\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/disrobe-sounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/github.png?raw=true\">\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdisrobe-sounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/modrinth.png?raw=true\">\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/disrobe-sounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/curseforge.png?raw=true\">\n          </a>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex\">\n          <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fXmGF7rkkuY\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/discord.png?raw=true\">\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.me%252fzipeleaf\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/telegram.png?raw=true\">\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fzipestudio%252ftip\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/support.png?raw=true\">\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/ZSdescription.png?raw=true\" alt=\"&quot;Description&quot; Title\"></p>\n<p><strong>Disrobe Sounds</strong>（脱衣音效）是一款客户端模组，为从装备栏移除的物品（如盔甲、马鞍等）添加了缺失的卸下音效。</p>\n<h1><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=adPvTPczRa0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">视频展示</a></h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/disrobe-sounds/blob/master/img/ds_banner.png?raw=true\" alt=\"&quot;Disrobe Sounds banner&quot;\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/ZScompatible.png?raw=true\" alt=\"&quot;Compatible&quot; Title\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>可与<strong>任何模组</strong>配合使用，只要该模组添加了盔甲、马铠、马鞍、地毯或任何可装备物品——只要物品能放入装备栏，该模组就会播放相应的卸下音效。</li>\n<li>在 Minecraft <strong>1.21.2 及更新版本</strong>中，自动支持任何带有 <code>equippable</code> 组件的物品。无需额外配置或特殊处理——开箱即用。</li>\n<li>与修改库存或装备系统的其他模组完全兼容，因为它仅监听槽位变化并播放音效，不会干扰游戏逻辑。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/ZSsupport.png?raw=true\" alt=\"&quot;Support&quot; Title\"></p>\n<h3>想要支持模组和作者？只需向所有人推荐此模组！</h3>\n<p>没错，你理解得对。仅仅通过宣传，你就能很好地支持该模组及其创作者。知道这个模组的人越多，下载量就越大；更多的下载量会给作者带来良好的动力，并增加网站收入（实际上是免费捐赠）。<strong>请记住，宣传必须不具侵入性且不令人厌烦！</strong></p>\n<h3>你可以做什么？</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>制作视频评测/广告</li>\n<li>在社交媒体或 Discord 上分享</li>\n<li>告诉你的朋友这个模组</li>\n<li>将其加入你的整合包，或者下载并享受游戏</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>每一次提及都很重要——感谢你帮助社区成长 🤍</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/ZSlicensing.png?raw=true\" alt=\"&quot;Licensing&quot; Title\"></p>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/disrobe-sounds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看原始模组仓库</a></h3>",
